  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For independent process at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 400px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Process</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>kJmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>/</mo><msup><mi>JK</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>80</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>The number of non-spontaneous process from the following is _____ .</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The relation&nbsp;between change in Gibbs free energy, change in enthalpy and change in entropy can be written as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#916;G</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#916;H</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>T&#916;S</mi></math></p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math> , then the process is said to be non-spontaneous and if&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math>&nbsp;then the process is said to be spontaneous.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#916;G</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>Jmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#916;G</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>Jmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#916;G</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>Jmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>&#916;G</mi><mfenced><msup><mi>Jmol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>300</mn><mo>:</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ve</mi></math></p><p>Processes <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math> are non-spontaneous.</p>",
